      "role": "user",
      "content": "20-30 tablets?? that sounds like way too many, i'm worried that might make me sick or something. and the feeling isn't just burning, sometimes it feels really heavy like someone is sitting on my chest, especially when i'm moving around. are you sure it's just heartburn and i don't need to go to the clinic or anything?",
